{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/8e2876a3eaad5baa93ef437846bfdfab.avif?t=1773885638\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras_big/8e2876a3eaad5baa93ef437846bfdfab.webp?t=1773885638 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 Roll. Connect. Explode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spaceship runs on nine dice arranged in a 3\u00d73 grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each roll, all possible lines are scored:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Include horizontal, vertical, and diagonal connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/b747edd42b349a334217e5076cd46344.poster.avif?t=1773885638\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/b747edd42b349a334217e5076cd46344.webm?t=1773885638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd27 Build Your Dice Engine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice are fully customizable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change face values</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add special abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust roll probabilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create consistent scaling builds or chase high-risk, high-reward combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a new experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/4b6543ec9282fff11745710a7782df30.poster.avif?t=1773885638\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/4b6543ec9282fff11745710a7782df30.webm?t=1773885638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\ud83e\uddff Relics That Break the Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful Relics that change how the rules work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn impossible rolls into guaranteed explosions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics can be fused, enchanted , and spiral completely out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/642ee107ddb971bd172cd163a1d5087c.poster.avif?t=1773885638\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/642ee107ddb971bd172cd163a1d5087c.webm?t=1773885638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\ud83d\ude80 A Roguelike Experience </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 increasingly demanding stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random relics and dice modifications</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple build paths and strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure isn\u2019t punishment \u2014 it\u2019s progress toward a stronger run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/a4e6e742f4d8bea37c0bf5e492423628.poster.avif?t=1773885638\" width=1024 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/a4e6e742f4d8bea37c0bf5e492423628.webm?t=1773885638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\ud83c\udf0c Reach the Final Star</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Stardust, push your build beyond its limits,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and reach the  Final Star.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018280?t=1773885638","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/4365cdc1c6df87cf16d1608197bc50186e1bf60d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773885638","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/7520a7b582256d37c4c2f5f92880469d2e157476/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773885638","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/7520a7b582256d37c4c2f5f92880469d2e157476/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773885638","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4306490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras/8e2876a3eaad5baa93ef437846bfdfab.avif?t=1773885638\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018280/extras_big/8e2876a3eaad5baa93ef437846bfdfab.webp?t=1773885638 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 Roll. Connect. Explode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spaceship runs on nine dice arranged in a 3\u00d73 grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each roll, all possible lines are scored:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Include horizontal, vertical, and diagonal connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://sh